    wherePlayerIs: 'Close under a target: the opposite of Backdraft''s safe low spot.'
    idea: The forge's spray of hot slag.
  designNotes: 'A close-range epic: 6 pellets in a 30 degree cone replace the main
    guns, 1.4 damage each point-blank (about 3x the base DPS when all land), falling
    to half at the end of their 5-unit range (Shots > Scatter ...). At about 2x point-blank
    it lost damage for an aggressive bot (x0.82): closing in costs time and hits.
    Now x1.28 DPS for a bot that closes in, with more hits taken: the trade is the
    point.'
